OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain around the east coast
OL,6,Fearly morning. Otherwise a day of
OL,7,Fsunshine and showers with outbreaks
OL,8,Ffocused across Moray and western
OL,9,FAberdeenshire, where they build for
OL,10,Fthe afternoon. Brisk southwest winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers dying away from the
OL,13,Feast through the evening, to leave a
OL,14,Flargely dry but increasingly cloudy
OL,15,Fnight. Brisk westerly winds easing
OL,16,Fovernight as they back to the
OL,17,Fsouthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
