OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWindy. Many dry through to
OL,6,Fmid-afternoon with some early
OL,7,Fbrightness in east. Patchy rain in far
OL,8,Fwest building and extending to rest of
OL,9,Fthe area late afternoon to early
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,13,Frain Thursday across the east and
OL,14,Fsouth, clearing erratically as
OL,15,Fbrighter spells and showers feed from
OL,16,Fwest. Scattered showers for Friday,
OL,17,Ffocused in west. Saturday mainly dry,
OL,18,Foccasionally bright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
